  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "53",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 53"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "53",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’o ne kiiyan ng’alekyok? Ak kiging’ang’ji ng’o eutab Jehovah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu tun eetu eng’ tainnyi ko u ketit ne ng’arng’ar, ak eetu ko u tigitiot eng’ emet ne yaamat: matinyei iton anan kororonindo; ak ye kigeere inendet ko mami korornindo kot kecham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigisas, ak kiesio bik inendet; chitab arogenosiek, ne ingen ng’wanindo: ak kigisas inendet ko u chito ne ung’e bik togochikwak, ama kiit inendet kele kiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiib iman ng’woninwekyok, ak kigesen arogenosiekyok: ago kigiit inendet kele kigibir, kibir Kamuktaindet ak konyalil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kigitoor agobo bistaosiekyok, kigiguoten agobo tengekwogikyok: kinyoru kalyennyo eng’ birennyi; ak kisoobenech birutikyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki u achek tugul kechirek che kigobetyo; kigosub age tugul eng’ achek orennyi; ak kigonde Jehovah inendet tengekwogikyok achek tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiginyalil, ago kiiming’ingei, ma twek; kiigei inendet aruetab kechir ne kikweriei kwo ole kieng’e, ko u kechiriet ne sisei eng’ taitab bik che tilei kororikyik; ee, ma twek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiginam eng’ suriet ak kiruokyi; ak ng’o ne ibwati eng’ ibindanyi kole kigiisto inendet eng’ emetab che soptos: Amu kigibir agobo bistoetab bikyuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyachi inendet kererit koboto kiptengeginik, ago kigitub eng’ meennyi koboto magorek; nganda kima yai koromnatet age tugul, ama mong’une kutinnyi ng’alset age tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kicham Jehovah koguoten inendet; kiigochi arogenet; ye tun iyai sobondanyi koek kagochinet agobo tengekto, tun keerei iyotennyi, tun tesei betusiekyik, ak kotesak chametab Jehovah eng’ eunnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tun keerei che biitune ng’wanindab sobondanyi, ak koyam; tun iityin otwogindennyu ne bo iman, imanda, bik che chang’, eng’ naennyi: ak tun ibei tengekwogikwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apchechini anyun inendet kebeberta koboto bik che eechen, ak kopchei barunenik koboto bik che kimen; amu kiigoito sobondanyi agoi meet, ak kigiitito bistoik: ago kigesen tengekwogikab bik che chang’, ak kisa agobo bistoik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
